{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06730","headline":"悲哉行 · 王昌龄","name":"悲哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勿听白头吟，人间易忧怨。\n若非沧浪子，安得从所愿。\n北上太行山，临风阅吹万。\n长云数千里，倏忽还肤寸。\n观其微灭时，精意莫能论。\n百年不容息，是处生意蔓。\n始悟海上人，辞君永飞遯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}